e="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Down payment (%)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coDown" type="number" placeholder="Enter %" oninput="coCalc()"></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Rate (%, from your lender&#39;s quote)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coRate" type="number" step="0.125" placeholder="Your rate" oninput="coCalc()"></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Term (years)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coTerm" type="number" value="30" oninput="coCalc()"></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Location</label><select class="idx-select" id="coLoc" onchange="coCalc()"><option value="254.6|83.4">City of Myrtle Beach</option><option value="221.2|0">North Myrtle Beach</option><option value="214.2|0">Surfside Beach</option><option value="272.5|0">Conway</option><option value="207.3|0">Murrells Inlet / Garden City</option><option value="201.0|0" selected>Unincorporated Horry (Carolina Forest, Socastee, Little River)</option></select></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">How you will own it</label><select class="idx-select" id="coStatus" onchange="coCalc()"><option value="4" selected>My legal residence (4%)</option><option value="6">Second home or rental (6%)</option></select></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Insurance ($/mo, your estimate)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coIns" type="number" value="160" oninput="coCalc()"></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">HOA dues ($/mo)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coHoa" type="number" value="0" oninput="coCalc()"></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Upkeep reserve (% of value / yr)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coMaint" type="number" step="0.25" value="1" oninput="coCalc()"></div></div><div style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:1rem;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--navy);display:grid;gap:.35rem"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>Loan payment (principal + interest)</span><strong id="coPI">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>Property taxes</span><strong id="coTax">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>Insurance</span><strong id="coInsOut">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>HOA dues</span><strong id="coHoaOut">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>Upkeep reserve</span><strong id="coUp">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:.6rem;font-size:1.05rem"><span><strong>True monthly cost</strong></span><strong id="coTotal" style="color:var(--brass)">$0</strong></div></div><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:.9rem;line-height:1.5">Tax math mirrors our <a href="/buyers/property-taxes/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">property tax calculator</a>: Horry County&#39;s 2026 certified millage, the Act 388 school exemption on legal residences, and the Myrtle Beach TDF credit. It excludes the 65+ homestead exemption and small special districts. Insurance is your estimate; see <a href="/buyers/coastal-insurance/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">coastal insurance costs</a>. Example math for planning, not an offer or quote of credit. Your rate and terms come from your lender.</p></div><script>
